flowchart TD
    %% Code-driven validation and release handoff
    A[Developer pushes code or opens PR] --> B[GitHub Actions validation]
    B --> C[Run linting and tests]

    C --> D[Training workflow]
    D --> E[Training tests and smoke run]
    E --> F[Release handoff contract]
    F --> G[Training image plus job configuration]

    C --> H[Inference workflow]
    H --> I[API tests]
    I --> J[Build/tag model-agnostic inference image]
    J --> K[Inference image metadata]

    %% Data-driven training workflow
    L[New training data lands in S3] --> M[S3 ObjectCreated event]
    M --> N[EventBridge rule]
    N --> O[Start SageMaker Pipeline execution]
    G --> O
    O --> P[Preprocess/validate data]
    P --> Q[Run SageMaker Training Job on managed compute]
    Q --> R[Evaluate model quality]
    R --> S[Write versioned model artifact to S3 or registry]

    %% Promotion and inference runtime
    S --> T[Promote approved artifact reference]
    T --> U[Production runtime MODEL_ARTIFACT_URI]
    K --> V[Deploy/restart inference service]
    U --> V
    V --> W[Flask service starts]
    W --> X[Fetch model artifact from external store]
    X --> Y[Load model into memory]
    Y --> Z[Serve /health and /predict]
